<title>FINLAND: Valmet to build machine for Georgia.</title>
<headline>Valmet to build machine for Georgia.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish paper machine maker Valmet Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it won an order for a new tissue paper machine from Georgia-Pacific Corp of the United States, but gave no value for the order.  </p>
<p>&quot;Valmet has received an order for a complete tissue machine and auxiliary equipment for the Georgia-Pacific expansion at its Crossett mill in Arkansas,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The machine would be delivered about one year from now, Valmet said, but did not give its output capacity.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
